<title>USA: CCPR Services sets $200 mln 144A snr sub notes.</title>
<headline>CCPR Services sets $200 mln 144A snr sub notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from CCPR Services Inc priced in the private placement market on Tuesday, via Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER CCPR SERVICES INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE  AFTER FIVE</p>
<p>								YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
